<title>IRAQ: PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Feb 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Iraq - Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the official Iraqi press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THAWRA</p>
<p>- President Saddam Hussein provides clothes to orphanages in Baghdad and provinces.</p>
<p>- Ministry of agriculture to pay 90 percent of prices of corn in advance to farmers.</p>
<p>- Campaign to repair Iraqi rails.</p>
<p>- Editorial and commentary lambast U.S. again for claims of instability in Iraq.</p>
</text>
